Z||000011||Kelvin Vivian||03-03-2001||01:32 AM||||I figured out what happened with Geocities... If you want to image source a pic from their site, the pic has to actually appear on your website, otherwise you won't be able to access it from other websites... You cannot just save it onto their file manager!!!<P>Sig should work now...<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/no_18/finalfront.jpg">    1987 SE - 4-cyl, 5-spd||||reg||1
